---
title: Clover Club
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, gin]
source: Classic cocktail, number 22 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{} without ice, pour @gin{1.5%fl_oz}, @dry vermouth{0.5%fl_oz}, @lemon juice{0.5%fl_oz}, @raspberry syrup{0.5%fl_oz} and @egg white{0.5}. Shake hard for ~{10%seconds}, add ice, and shake again for ~{10%seconds}. Double strain into a #coupe glass{}(well chilled), and garnish with @raspberries{3}.

> No raspberry syrup? Press four raspberries in the shaker with half an ounce of simple syrup instead.
